job_description:
Position: Content Operations Specialist (Sunrise Retail Ltd)
Responsibilities:
1. Plan and publish content for brand accounts;
2. Organize campaign plans for promotion seasons;
3. Review user feedback and summarize operation data;
4. Coordinate with designers and support agents.
Requirements:
1. Bachelor degree, major open;
2. Strong writing skills, familiar with major content platforms;
3. Data aware, able to write basic reviews;
4. E-commerce experience preferred.
